"                                                                                                                        "
"                                                                                                                        "
"                        ╭ First start ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮                        "
"                        │ Before your first session, one setting needs your answer. Press ,    │                        "
"                        │ later to change it.                                                  │                        "
"                        │                                                                      │                        "
"                        │ Keep copies of the files a session showed you?                       │                        "
"                        │ Files a session shows are often temporary. Replay can show them      │                        "
"                        │ later only if a copy was kept.                                       │                        "
"                        │ ❯ (•) compact copies                                       ◀ default │                        "
"                        │       Compact copies: images are kept as WebP copies, about a fifth  │                        "
"                        │       of their size; every other file is kept as it is.              │                        "
"                        │   ( ) exact copies                                                   │                        "
"                        │       Exact copies: every file is kept byte for byte, images         │                        "
"                        │       included.                                                      │                        "
"                        │   ( ) no copies                                                      │                        "
"                        │       No copies: no file is kept. asqr still records each file's     │                        "
"                        │       size and checksum, so a replay can tell the file is gone.      │                        "
"                        │                                                                      │                        "
"                        │   [ Save and start ]                                                 │                        "
"                        │                                                                      │                        "
"                        │ q quits without writing; the next start asks again.                  │                        "
"                        ╰───────────── writes ~/Library/Application Support/asqr/settings.toml ╯                        "
"                                                                                                                        "
"                                                                                                                        "
"                                                                                                                        "
